flowchart TD
  Candidate[Candidate artifact] --> Claims[Enumerate claims]
  Claims --> Procedures[Select required procedures]
  Procedures --> Run[Execute tests / inspections]
  Run --> Evidence[Evidence records]
  Evidence --> Fresh{Fresh and sufficient?}
  Fresh -- no --> Unknown[NOT_RUN / UNKNOWN / BLOCKED]
  Fresh -- yes --> Report[VerificationReport]
  Unknown --> Report
  Report --> Review[Independent or separated critique]
  Review --> Assurance[Assurance decision]
